When you want to publish a new version of CrossTest Java/Cucumber documentation, make sure to:
1. Build the documentation with mkdocs_build.ps1.
2. Upload the contents of the site/ folder to ftp://xbreeze@x-breeze.com/test.x-breeze.com/Java/
